msgstr "Paramètres de marque enregistrés avec succès."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-add-column-handler.php:48
msgid "Add Column to Section"
msgstr "Ajouter une colonne à la section"

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-add-column-handler.php:49
msgid "Adds a column to an existing section or container in any Elementor post. Automatically redistributes column sizes to fit."
msgstr "Ajoute une colonne à une section ou un conteneur existant dans n'importe quel post Elementor. Redistribue automatiquement les tailles de colonne pour s'adapter."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-add-column-handler.php:60
#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-add-section-handler.php:59
#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-build-handler.php:60
#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-insert-widget-handler.php:59
#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-move-element-handler.php:60
#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-remove-element-handler.php:59
#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-structure-handler.php:59
#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-update-widget-handler.php:60
msgid "Any Elementor-enabled post ID (page, post, or template)."
msgstr "Tout ID de post activé par Elementor (page, post ou modèle)."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-add-column-handler.php:64
msgid "Section or container element ID to add column to."
msgstr "ID de l'élément de section ou de conteneur auquel ajouter la colonne."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-add-column-handler.php:69
msgid "If true, automatically redistributes all column sizes evenly."
msgstr "Si vrai, redistribue automatiquement toutes les tailles de colonne de manière uniforme."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-add-column-handler.php:121
msgid "section_id is required."
msgstr "section_id est requis."

#. translators: 1: Section ID, 2: Post title, 3: Column ID
#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-add-column-handler.php:148
msgid "Added column to section %1$s in \"%2$s\". Use builder/insert-widget with position {\"inside\": \"%3$s\"} to add widgets."
msgstr "Colonne ajoutée à la section %1$s dans \"%2$s\". Utilisez builder/insert-widget avec la position {\"inside\": \"%3$s\"} pour ajouter des widgets."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-add-section-handler.php:47
msgid "Add Section/Container"
msgstr "Ajouter une section/conteneur"

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-add-section-handler.php:48
msgid "Adds a structural layout element to any Elementor post. On legacy sites: creates a section with columns. On container sites: creates a flex container with child containers. Supports inner sections and multi-column layouts."
msgstr "Ajoute un élément de mise en page structurel à tout post Elementor. Sur les sites hérités : crée une section avec des colonnes. Sur les sites de conteneurs : crée un conteneur flex avec des conteneurs enfants. Prend en charge les sections intérieures et les mises en page à colonnes multiples."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-add-section-handler.php:65
msgid "Array of column size percentages. Must sum to 100. E.g., [50, 50] for two equal columns, [33, 34, 33] for three columns, [25, 75] for sidebar layout."
msgstr "Tableau de pourcentages de taille de colonnes. Doit totaliser 100. Par exemple, [50, 50] pour deux colonnes égales, [33, 34, 33] pour trois colonnes, [25, 75] pour une mise en page de barre latérale."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-add-section-handler.php:70
msgid "If true, creates an inner section (must be placed inside a column). On container sites, creates a nested container."
msgstr "Si vrai, crée une section intérieure (doit être placée à l'intérieur d'une colonne). Sur les sites de conteneurs, crée un conteneur imbriqué."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-add-section-handler.php:73
msgid "Where to insert: \"append\" (default), \"prepend\", { \"after\": \"element_id\" }, { \"before\": \"element_id\" }, { \"inside\": \"element_id\" } (for inner sections inside a column/container)."
msgstr "Où insérer : \"ajouter\" (par défaut), \"préparer\", { \"après\": \"element_id\" }, { \"avant\": \"element_id\" }, { \"à l'intérieur\": \"element_id\" } (pour les sections intérieures à l'intérieur d'une colonne/conteneur)."

#. translators: %d: total of column sizes
#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-add-section-handler.php:135
msgid "Column sizes must sum to 100. Got %d."
msgstr "Les tailles de colonnes doivent totaliser 100. Obtenu %d."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-add-section-handler.php:184
msgid "inner section"
msgstr "section intérieure"

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-add-section-handler.php:185
msgid "container"
msgstr "conteneur"

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-add-section-handler.php:185
msgid "section"
msgstr "section"

#. translators: 1: Element type, 2: Number of columns, 3: Post title
#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-add-section-handler.php:194
msgid "Added %1$s with %2$d column(s) to \"%3$s\". Use column_ids to insert widgets into specific columns."
msgstr "Ajouté %1$s avec %2$d colonne(s) à \"%3$s\". Utilisez column_ids pour insérer des widgets dans des colonnes spécifiques."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-build-handler.php:48
msgid "Build Complete Layout"
msgstr "Construire une mise en page complète"

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-build-handler.php:49
msgid "Builds a complete layout with sections, columns, and widgets in one call. Replaces all content on the post. The structure parameter is a JSON string describing rows and widgets."
msgstr "Construit une mise en page complète avec des sections, des colonnes et des widgets en un seul appel. Remplace tout le contenu du post. Le paramètre de structure est une chaîne JSON décrivant les lignes et les widgets."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-build-handler.php:125
msgid "structure is not valid JSON. It must be a minified JSON array string."
msgstr "La structure n'est pas un JSON valide. Elle doit être une chaîne de tableau JSON minifiée."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-build-handler.php:134
msgid "structure must be a JSON array of section objects. Example: [{\"columns\":[20,60,20],\"children\":[{\"type\":\"widget\",\"widget_type\":\"site-logo\",\"settings\":{}}]}]"
msgstr "La structure doit être un tableau JSON d'objets section. Exemple : [{\"columns\":[20,60,20],\"children\":[{\"type\":\"widget\",\"widget_type\":\"site-logo\",\"settings\":{}}]}]"

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-build-handler.php:144
msgid "Each item in structure must be a section object with \"children\". Example: {\"columns\":[20,60,20],\"children\":[{\"type\":\"widget\",\"widget_type\":\"site-logo\",\"settings\":{}}]}"
msgstr "Chaque élément de la structure doit être un objet section avec \"children\". Exemple : {\"columns\":[20,60,20],\"children\":[{\"type\":\"widget\",\"widget_type\":\"site-logo\",\"settings\":{}}]}"

#. translators: 1: Number of elements, 2: Post title
#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-build-handler.php:177
msgid "Built \"%2$s\" with %1$d elements."
msgstr "Construit \"%2$s\" avec %1$d éléments."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-css-handler.php:47
msgid "Regenerate CSS"
msgstr "Régénérer CSS"

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-css-handler.php:48
msgid "Forces Elementor to regenerate CSS files for a post so frontend changes appear immediately. Call after builder/build or any structural change."
msgstr "Force Elementor à régénérer les fichiers CSS pour un post afin que les modifications frontend apparaissent immédiatement. Appeler après builder/build ou tout changement structurel."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-css-handler.php:59
msgid "Any Elementor-enabled post ID. Pass 0 to regenerate all Elementor CSS globally."
msgstr "Tout ID de post activé par Elementor. Passez 0 pour régénérer tous les CSS Elementor globalement."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-css-handler.php:109
msgid "You are not allowed to regenerate all Elementor CSS globally."
msgstr "Vous n'êtes pas autorisé à régénérer tous les CSS Elementor globalement."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-css-handler.php:119
msgid "Regenerated all Elementor CSS files globally."
msgstr "Tous les fichiers CSS Elementor régénérés globalement."

#. translators: %s: Post title
#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-css-handler.php:136
msgid "Regenerated CSS for \"%s\"."
msgstr "CSS régénéré pour \"%s\"."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-insert-widget-handler.php:47
msgid "Insert Widget"
msgstr "Insérer un widget"

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-insert-widget-handler.php:48
msgid "Inserts a single widget into an existing Elementor post. KEY WIDGET SLUGS — Core: heading, text-editor, image, button, spacer, divider. UAE Pro: uael-infobox (Info Box), uael-price-table (Price Box), uael-advanced-heading, uael-posts, uael-business-reviews. Use list-widget-types to discover all available slugs and get-schema for each widget's settings."
msgstr "Insère un seul widget dans un post Elementor existant. SLUGS DE WIDGET CLÉS — Noyau : heading, text-editor, image, button, spacer, divider. UAE Pro : uael-infobox (Info Box), uael-price-table (Price Box), uael-advanced-heading, uael-posts, uael-business-reviews. Utilisez list-widget-types pour découvrir tous les slugs disponibles et get-schema pour les paramètres de chaque widget."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-insert-widget-handler.php:63
msgid "Widget type slug (e.g. \"navigation-menu\", \"site-logo\", \"heading\"). Use builder/list-widget-types to see available types."
msgstr "Slug de type de widget (par exemple, \"navigation-menu\", \"site-logo\", \"heading\"). Utilisez builder/list-widget-types pour voir les types disponibles."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-insert-widget-handler.php:67
msgid "JSON string of widget settings. Use builder/get-schema to discover the keys. Example: {\"heading_title\":\"My Heading\",\"align\":\"center\"}. Pass empty string or \"{}\" for defaults."
msgstr "Chaîne JSON des paramètres du widget. Utilisez builder/get-schema pour découvrir les clés. Exemple : {\"heading_title\":\"Mon Titre\",\"align\":\"center\"}. Passez une chaîne vide ou \"{}\" pour les valeurs par défaut."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-insert-widget-handler.php:71
msgid "Where to insert: \"append\" (default), \"prepend\", a number for index position (0=first, 1=second, etc.), or { \"after\": \"element_id\" }, { \"before\": \"element_id\" }, { \"inside\": \"container_id\" }."
msgstr "Où insérer : \"append\" (par défaut), \"prepend\", un nombre pour la position d'index (0=premier, 1=deuxième, etc.), ou { \"after\": \"element_id\" }, { \"before\": \"element_id\" }, { \"inside\": \"container_id\" }."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-insert-widget-handler.php:117
msgid "Widget type is required."
msgstr "Le type de widget est requis."

#. translators: %s: Widget type slug
#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-insert-widget-handler.php:138
msgid "Widget type \"%s\" is not recognized. Use builder/list-widget-types to see available types."
msgstr "Le type de widget \"%s\" n'est pas reconnu. Utilisez builder/list-widget-types pour voir les types disponibles."

#. translators: 1: Widget type, 2: Post title
#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-insert-widget-handler.php:185
msgid "Inserted %1$s widget into \"%2$s\"."
msgstr "Widget %1$s inséré dans \"%2$s\"."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-move-element-handler.php:48
msgid "Move Element"
msgstr "Déplacer l'élément"

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-move-element-handler.php:49
msgid "Repositions an element within any Elementor post. Removes from current location and inserts at new position."
msgstr "Repositionne un élément dans n'importe quel post Elementor. Supprime de l'emplacement actuel et insère à la nouvelle position."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-move-element-handler.php:64
msgid "Element ID to move."
msgstr "ID de l'élément à déplacer."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-move-element-handler.php:67
msgid "New position: { \"after\": \"element_id\" } or { \"before\": \"element_id\" }."
msgstr "Nouvelle position : { \"after\": \"element_id\" } ou { \"before\": \"element_id\" }."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-move-element-handler.php:112
#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-remove-element-handler.php:107
#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-update-widget-handler.php:125
msgid "Element ID is required."
msgstr "L'ID de l'élément est requis."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-move-element-handler.php:120
msgid "Position is required."
msgstr "La position est requise."

#. translators: 1: Element ID, 2: Post title
#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-move-element-handler.php:147
msgid "Moved element %1$s in \"%2$s\"."
msgstr "Élément %1$s déplacé dans \"%2$s\"."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-remove-element-handler.php:47
msgid "Remove Element"
msgstr "Supprimer l'élément"

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-remove-element-handler.php:48
msgid "Removes a widget or container from any Elementor post by element ID."
msgstr "Supprime un widget ou un conteneur de n'importe quel post Elementor par ID d'élément."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-remove-element-handler.php:63
msgid "Element ID to remove."
msgstr "ID de l'élément à supprimer."

#. translators: 1: Element ID, 2: Post title
#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-remove-element-handler.php:134
msgid "Removed element %1$s from \"%2$s\"."
msgstr "Élément %1$s supprimé de \"%2$s\"."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-schema-handler.php:48
msgid "Get Element Schema"
msgstr "Obtenir le schéma de l'élément"

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-schema-handler.php:49
msgid "Returns a settings schema for widgets, sections, containers, or columns. Use before building layouts to discover available settings."
msgstr "Renvoie un schéma de paramètres pour les widgets, sections, conteneurs ou colonnes. Utilisez avant de construire des mises en page pour découvrir les paramètres disponibles."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-schema-handler.php:61
msgid "Type of element to get schema for."
msgstr "Type d'élément pour lequel obtenir le schéma."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-schema-handler.php:65
msgid "Widget type slug (required when type=widget). E.g., \"heading\", \"navigation-menu\"."
msgstr "Slug de type de widget (requis lorsque type=widget). Par exemple, \"heading\", \"navigation-menu\"."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-schema-handler.php:71
msgid "Which settings tab to include. Defaults to \"all\" which returns content + style settings."
msgstr "Quel onglet de paramètres inclure. Par défaut, \"all\" renvoie les paramètres de contenu + style."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-schema-handler.php:120
msgid "Type must be one of: widget, section, container, column."
msgstr "Le type doit être l'un des suivants : widget, section, conteneur, colonne."

#: abilities/handlers/builder/class-uael-schema-handler.php:139
msgid "widget_type is required when type=widget."
msgstr "widget_type est requis lorsque type=widget."

#. translators: %s: widget type slug
